<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I love the name of Him whose heart</l><l>Knows all my griefs and bears a part;</l><l>Who bids all anxious fears depart,</l><l>I love the name of Jesus.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>That name I fondly love to hear,</l><l>It never fails my heart to cheer,</l><l>Its music dries the falling tear;</l><l>Exalt the name of Jesus.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>No word of man can ever tell</l><l>How sweet the name I love so well,</l><l>Oh, let its praises ever swell,</l><l>Oh, praise the name of Jesus.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
